WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.436 --> 00:00:02.657
Hello! [s@Hello!

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:04.737
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.757 --> 00:00:06.178
I'm a sea horse.

4
00:00:06.198 --> 00:00:07.298
But I'm not a horse.

5
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.382
I'm a really small fish!

6
00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:16.082
Where do you live?

7
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:34.433
Sea horses live in the ocean.

8
00:00:35.914 --> 00:00:38.515
We like warm water near land.

9
00:00:40.796 --> 00:00:41.876
What do you eat?

10
00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:45.978
Sea horses eat small crustaceans.

11
00:00:47.319 --> 00:00:48.659
We don't have teeth.

12
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.821
We suck up food with our mouths.

13
00:00:55.002 --> 00:00:56.302
Who are your enemies?

14
00:00:57.703 --> 00:00:59.384
Crabs like to hunt us.

15
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.341
Sometimes people catch us too.

16
00:01:05.902 --> 00:01:07.903
Do sea horses lay eggs?

17
00:01:09.644 --> 00:01:13.885
Yes. Females lay eggs and give them to males.

18
00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:17.447
Males carry them in a pouch.

19
00:01:18.687 --> 00:01:20.308
Finally the eggs hatch.

20
00:01:23.429 --> 00:01:24.850
Are you a good swimmer?

21
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.752
No! We are the slowest fish.

22
00:01:31.468 --> 00:01:33.850
Our fins are not good for swimming.

23
00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:38.554
So sea horses don't move around much.

24
00:01:41.056 --> 00:01:42.557
You have a long tail!

25
00:01:46.961 --> 00:01:49.964
We grab plants or coral with our tails.

26
00:01:51.505 --> 00:01:53.607
This helps us stay in one place.

27
00:02:00.064 --> 00:02:01.207
Oh! I see food.

28
00:02:02.549 --> 00:02:03.652
It's time to eat.

29
00:02:05.555 --> 00:02:06.056
Good-bye,
